      "cooked": "<p>Hi All.</p><p>New forum member here, and recent initiate to this wonderful game.</p><p>First off, I am sorry if this has been asked already, but a search of the forums and google didn't turn anything up.</p><p>During a recent game, an interesting question came up.</p><p>K.N.Y.F.E.'s Flawless Execution</p><p>1) Does this card work on&nbsp;<span>Villain&nbsp;</span>character cards? (One would assume, but it seems the one card that does not exclude it)</p><p>2) If it does work on&nbsp;<span>Villain&nbsp;</span>character cards, does it prevent Apostate from flipping?</p><p>Thanks for the help.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:43:07.885Z",
