      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
      "created_at": "2014-12-31T20:25:48.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I think so, yeah - you try to destroy them using whatever attack you're using (Flawless Execution, Sucker Punch, etc), and then their own text of \"when this card would be destroyed...\" kicks in and you instead flip them. The Unforgiving Wasteland gets around even flip mechanics, however, so stuff killed by the environment (heroes or anything else) when that card is out are fully removed and not just flipped.</p>",
